                            <comment id="15533367" author="amashenkov" created="Thu, 29 Sep 2016 17:13:39 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve commited fix affected atomic cache. But we still can loose events in transactional cache.&lt;br/&gt;
Events can be lost while entry was putting primary node for the entry key left topology.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15564769" author="vozerov" created="Tue, 11 Oct 2016 07:35:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Andrey,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The tests you created are not &quot;load&quot; tests, but &quot;failover&quot; tests in our usual terms. And we already have failover tests for CQ - &lt;tt&gt;CacheContinuousQueryFailoverAbstractSelfTest&lt;/tt&gt;. &lt;br/&gt;
I do not want us to create more long running tests unless it is really needed. Please investigate whether we can improve existing tests instead.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Vladimir.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
